name: Glass Card — destruction
author: corpus
description: >-
  Event: a Glass Card is destroyed while scoring. Tight Ante 1 event: a glass card shatters
  and scales Glass Joker.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - glassDestroy: [1]
should:
  - joker: GlassJoker
    score: 45
  - joker: Seltzer
    score: 35
  - joker: Dusk
    score: 30
